###! Get current user (senior)
GET {{host}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{seniorToken}}

###! Get current user (volunteer)
GET {{host}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteerToken}}

### Update FCM token (senior)
PATCH {{host}}/api/me/fcm-token
Authorization: Bearer {{seniorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fcm_token": "test-fcm-token-senior-001"
}

### Update FCM token (volunteer)
PATCH {{host}}/api/me/fcm-token
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fcm_token": "test-fcm-token-volunteer-001"
}

### /me without token -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/me

### fcm-token with police role -> 403
PATCH {{host}}/api/me/fcm-token
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fcm_token": "test-fcm-token-police-001"
}